# PlusTok ACEP — Enterprise Rules

## Start Here (every session)

1. Read [INDEX.md](../../INDEX.md) — navigation & STEP map
2. Read [00_PROJECT_MASTER.md](../../00_PROJECT_MASTER.md) — project constitution
3. Read the relevant STEP SSOT + folder `_XXX_INDEX.md` before implementing

## SSOT Paths (STEP 1~8)

| STEP | Folder | Index |
|------|--------|-------|
| 1 | `02_UIUX/` | `_UIUX_INDEX.md` |
| 2 | `03_SYSTEM/` | `_SYSTEM_INDEX.md` |
| 3 | `04_AI/` | `_AI_INDEX.md` |
| 4 | `05_CHAT/` | `_CHAT_INDEX.md` |
| 5 | `06_CRM/`, `06_FRONTEND/` | `_CRM_INDEX.md`, `_FRONTEND_INDEX.md` |
