Archive only (do not treat as SSOT): `08_TEST/`, `09_RELEASE/`.

## Stack

- **Backend:** PHP 8.4, MySQL 8, Redis — `api/`, `includes/`, `admin/`
- **Frontend:** React 18 + TypeScript + Vite — `frontend/`
- **Real-time:** Socket.io (server + client) — see `05_CHAT/01_WebSocket설계.md`
- **AI:** `ai_call()` in `includes/ai.php` — never call providers directly

## AI Failover (mandatory)

Auto chain: **Claude → OpenAI → Gemini → Grok → DeepSeek**

- Use `ai_call()` only; log to `ai_logs` / `ai_failover_log`
- API keys in `ai_provider_config` / env — **never hardcode keys in source**
- Prompts from `ai_prompts` table — see `04_AI/02_Prompt설계.md`

## Coding Conventions

- **PHP/DB:** snake_case tables & columns; camelCase PHP functions per existing `includes/`
- **React/TS:** camelCase props & state; match `UI_COMPONENTS_GUIDE` interfaces
- **Docs/files:** folders `NN_영문`, SSOT docs `NN_한글설명.md`
- **Comments:** business logic may use Korean; identifiers & code in English

## Before Implementing

- [ ] Relevant STEP doc + Cross References read
- [ ] DB schema (`03_SYSTEM/01_DB설계.md`) & API (`03_SYSTEM/02_API설계.md`) checked
- [ ] Document checklist at bottom of STEP doc reviewed
- [ ] Test cases: `09_DEVELOPMENT/02_테스트시나리오.md`

## Forbidden

- Implementing without reading STEP SSOT
- Partial doc reads / ignoring Cross References
- Hardcoded API keys or secrets in code
- Bypassing `ai_call()` failover chain
